  "note_sha256": "ee59c984c99f78c51708e89ce17ea1cf58e60987b192e49a54e00363472f8a29",
  "method": "Sum products of paired stored interval means over [0, falling power edge), or the whole capture when the program is still active at its end; subtract the post-run tail mean power, borrowed from the nearest capture in time when no tail exists, and divide by Ntest.",
