    "No independent repeated captures or separate idle capture; idle comes from short post-run tails.",
    "No intra-interval V/I covariance correction, calibration budget or hardware-aligned workload markers.",
    "Ntest is the NTESTS loop count of test_kyber/test_dilithium/test_sphincsplus (operator-confirmed); the exact invocation and successful-operation counts are not recorded.",
    "Current maxima are maxima of stored interval means, not transient peaks."
  ],
